    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "Recommendation on the Pahia–Haʻikū community plan amendment from open space, agriculture and heavy industrial to public/quasi-public, multifamily, business commercial and single family: Commissioners voted unanimously to recommend that the County Council approve the community plan amendment.",
