        "endTs": "1:37:05"
      },
      "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "A small business owner who works in Pahia testified in strong support.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tcJLaiUZhjo",
        "ts": "1:33:39",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:57.780Z",
        "endTs": "1:34:30"
      },
      "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "The landowner's team plans two private wells for drinking water because the county system is basically at capacity.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "tcJLaiUZhjo",
        "ts": "0:55:47",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:57.780Z",
        "endTs": "0:56:17"
      },
      "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "Non-drinking water would come from an existing brackish well and treated wastewater.",
