        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:57.780Z",
        "endTs": "0:35:04"
      },
      "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "The landowner said the plan targets people priced out, including a 'gap group' that earns too much for traditional affordable housing but can't afford today's market.",
