        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:57.780Z",
        "endTs": "0:09:34"
      },
      "body": "Maui Planning Commission"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-08",
      "text": "The main item was a County Council proposal to change the community plan and zoning (land-use rules) for 40.392 acres in Pahia.",
